full-query: "You previously migrated a business-critical monolith application without modification from on-premises to Google Cloud. As a Database Engineer, you want to re-architect this application to use microservices. The application has a single backend database, but in the future you want to make the database architecture more suitable to microservices. You want to minimize downtime when you make database changes. What should you do?"
