  "qid": "179",
  "tip": "<p>When a question stresses <i>minimize downtime</i> during a migration to microservices, prefer <i>incremental</i> changes that keep the database stable at first. Avoid a <i>big bang</i> data split and avoid adding a central broker. Look for answers that let the data model <i>evolve</i> gradually once service boundaries are clear.</p>",
